    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause amends section 3 of the Nation Building Tax Act, No. 9 of 2009(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of the section asamended is to limit the period of exemption granted to certain cigarettes identified underHarmonized Commodity Description and Coding Numbers.",
